WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:14.476
Wow!

2
00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:19.457
Who are you?

3
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:22.959
I'm a manatee.

4
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.174
We are big mammals.

5
00:00:27.175 --> 00:00:30.760
You live in the sea, right?

6
00:00:30.761 --> 00:00:35.995
Manatees live in oceans and rivers.

7
00:00:35.996 --> 00:00:39.254
We like warm water.

8
00:00:39.255 --> 00:00:43.564
So we move to stay warm.

9
00:00:43.565 --> 00:00:46.156
What do you eat?

10
00:00:46.157 --> 00:00:49.910
We eat lots of plants.

11
00:00:49.911 --> 00:00:55.728
Sometimes we eat tiny fish by mistake.

12
00:00:55.729 --> 00:00:58.468
Are you a sea cow?

13
00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:02.882
Yes. Some people call us sea cows.

14
00:01:02.883 --> 00:01:05.981
But we're more like elephants.

15
00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:10.718
We both have thick skin and toenails.

16
00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:14.425
Do you ever go on land?

17
00:01:14.426 --> 00:01:17.583
No. Manatees stay in the water.

18
00:01:17.584 --> 00:01:24.701
But we come up often for air.

19
00:01:24.702 --> 00:01:27.976
How do you swim?

20
00:01:27.977 --> 00:01:32.510
We use our strong tails to move.

21
00:01:32.511 --> 00:01:44.085
We steer with our flippers.

22
00:01:44.086 --> 00:01:48.021
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:48.022 --> 00:01:51.725
We are gentle and friendly.

24
00:01:51.726 --> 00:01:56.338
But sometimes people hunt us.

25
00:01:56.339 --> 00:02:00.915
They also pollute our oceans and rivers.

26
00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:04.015
It's time for another swim.

27
00:02:04.016 --> 00:02:06.904
Good-bye!

28
00:02:06.905 --> 00:02:13.068
So long, Manatee!
